  "Revised days of a weekly schedule that arrived after the PDF (a mail, a picture of the grid).",
  "Applied on top of the PDF every time scripts/update.py reads that week, so the PDF itself is never edited.",
  "group -> Monday of the week -> days -> date -> row (section) -> one cell per time slot, left to right,",
  "typed exactly as on the schedule (\"\" for an empty cell). Every class the PDF had on a listed date is",
  "replaced by what is typed here; dates not listed keep what the PDF says.",
  "The room is the row's usual room. Faculty initials can be typed as they appear; they are not stored."
 ],
